// Dialog :
"P1388429731" "You're able to escape from wherever Mot sent you - you had better hurry!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2293376158" "Are you alright, {HeroName}? I was unable to reach your signature for a while. Some unknown man helped you escape, you say? Hrm... a third player within this place, then. Interesting.<br><br>It is too bad that the informant Max spoke of was unable to find more regarding this David Hazen. However, what he did find is somewhat... coincidental, almost to the point of fault.<br><br>You see, {HeroName}, we have officially lost all contact with Scirocco. He told Ice Mistral that it was over, and that it was time for him to face the <color red>Sentinel</color>."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Scirocco 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Villain Text :
"P528082592" "<color orange>Scirocco looks badly injured from the fight against the Sentinel. He struggles to his hands and knees, coughing hard.</color><br><br>She... she changed. Irena changed. She gave her life to save my own.<br><br><color orange>Scirocco looks up to you, punching the ground.</color><br><br>Perhaps, {HeroName}, you would seek to end my life now. I am weakened before you; I would barely be able to put up a fight, if any. But, I would ask, {HeroName}, for you to reconsider."
// Answer Text :
"P3609786149" "I'm not going to kill you, Scirocco."
// Answer Text :
"P1272613545" "And why should I reconsider?"
// Page PageBChoice1 Text :
"P968090293" "What? You're not...? Perhaps everyone around is changing except for myself, then.<br><br>Lord Recluse will try to order me back to Grandville now, but I will not be going. Not without Irena.<br><br>She is my student, {HeroName}, and my responsibility. I always thought... I always thought that she ignored me after all these years. In the end, if even someone as cold as her could change their ways... perhaps there is hope for myself. Maybe, perhaps, there is even hope for you.<br><br>I am going to stay in Astoria and find a way to save Irena; there <i>must</i> be something I can do to get her back.  Since you seem to be one of the last forces here against the creature, it would mean you and I will be working together."
// Answer Text :
"P541996991" "You're still badly hurt, Scirocco. You need to rest."
// Page PageBChoice2 Text :
"P4160025581" "I do not plan on going back to Arachnos at this time, {HeroName}. I will not rest until Mot is put down and Irena is rescued. I assume that you are after the same thing as I am: the destruction of Mot.<br><br>I will aid you as much as I can in this task, no matter the cost. In the end, if you wish to end me, then we shall fight once again. But, for now, however unwise it might be, I offer you my aid in fighting this menace."
// Answer Text :
"P2585503002" "You're no use to me now, you're too badly injured."
// Page PageBChoice1Part2 Text :
"P2883696114" "<color orange>Scirocco smirks tiredly and nods.</color><br><br>It will take some time for me to return to the battlefield, but I shall return shortly. I must take care of several things first, {HeroName}, if I am to be of any use.<br><br>The power of my mantle has always been limited by... several factors. If I am to ascend and fight Mot, I must release the full power of Scirocco, once and for all.<br><br>When you and I meet again, I shall be ready to fight against the evil here with you. I just hope that when the time comes, you will not show your true colors and take advantage of us all. I warn you, {HeroName}, I will put you down if you betray us all."
// Answer Text :
"P1026944035" "We'll see, Scirocco."
// Page PageBChoice2Part2 Text :
"P2825976388" "<color orange>Scirocco nods.</color><br><br>It will take some time for me to return to the battlefield, but I shall return. I must take care of several things first, {HeroName}, if I am to be of any use.<br><br>The power of my mantle has always been limited by... several factors. If I am to ascend and fight Mot, I must release the full power of Scirocco, once and for all.<br><br>When you and I meet again, I shall be ready to fight against the evil here with you. I just hope that when the time comes, you choose the power of life instead of death, {HeroName}."
// Page Regular Text :
"P513595174" "<color orange>Scirocco looks badly injured from the fight against the Sentinel. He struggles to his hands and knees, coughing hard.</color><br><br>She... she changed. Irena changed. She gave her life to save my own.<br><br><color orange>Scirocco looks up to you, punching the ground.</color><br><br>There was nobility in her, {HeroName}. She wanted to hide it, but I knew... I knew the monks had chosen her for a reason. They saw the same thing that I did, but she never wanted to see it until...<br><br>We have to save Irena, {HeroName}. I know that to you, she and I are the enemy. However... Irena has shown me something important, you must understand."
// Answer Text :
"P2896141587" "What did she show you?"
// Page PageCChoice1 Text :
"P4172061159" "That it is not too late to change, {HeroName}. I always felt... a prisoner to the present, to my circumstances. I had given up on Irena ever changing, I believed she, too, was a slave to her wild emotions, despite my best efforts.<br><br>But she showed me today that it isn't too late. You have to understand, {HeroName}. If I died here, Ice Mistral stood to inherit my position as a patron. She would've gained more power than she ever had. But yet... she chose to save me, instead.<br><br>I do not know if it is possible to save her, {HeroName}, but I will not give up until I know one way or another."
// Answer Text :
"P929734856" "You're too badly hurt to do much right now, Scirocco."
// Page PageCChoice1Part2 Text :
"P3130166368" "<color orange>Scirocco smiles tiredly and nods.</color><br><br>It will take some time for me to return to the battlefield, but I shall return. I must take care of several things first, {HeroName}, if I am to be of any use.<br><br>The power of my mantle has always been limited by... several factors. If I am to ascend and fight Mot, I must release the full power of Scirocco, once and for all.<br><br>When you and I meet again, I shall be ready to fight against the evil here with you. I know that I am a vile man, {HeroName}, but I ask that when that day comes, you will allow me to finally do what is right"
// Answer Text :
"P1115728963" "Alright, Scirocco, I'll see you then."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1074141827" "Ice Mistral had no idea what Scirocco was talking about with this Sentinel nonsense. However, if we go off of what was said in Hazen's journal, then it would appear that this is a major force behind Mot's power.<br><br>{HeroName}, if we could strike against the Sentinel, it would deal a <i>major</i> blow to Mot's power. Then, if things fall into place, Max will deliver the information on how we can cripple the Knives of Vengeance.<br><br>The two combined would be a major victory for us against Mot. Scirocco will be able to lead us right to the Sentinel; Ice Mistral tracked him down to an old cavern system nearby, but she was driven away by a pack of monsters from the Banished Pantheon. All you need to do is get there and take down the Sentinel."
// AcceptString :
"P3624772203" "What about Scirocco?"
// SendOffString :
"P535632610" "Scirocco? Look, {HeroName}, Scirocco has made his choice. Yes, I understand, Mot will become slightly more powerful if he takes Scirocco, but we will easily shift that when the Sentinel is defeated.<br><br>Scirocco recruited me into Arachnos, {HeroName}. The Scirocco that is in that cave now is a <i>far</i> cry from the one that found me. He has become weak-willed from the realization that he is in a place he does not like. If Scirocco were <i>truly</i> a powerful man, he would make the decision to continue to fight his fate, but he is not.<br><br>You're free to save him, though, as I certaintly do not have the power to stop you. Just bear in mind that <color orange>the Sentinel is most likely an extremely powerful foe. If you have any allies who would brave Astoria, now would be the time to call them.</color>"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1785929772" "Defeat the Sentinel of Mot"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3612115817" "You need to get that thing taken care off we talked about earlier."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P1046843905" "<color deepskyblue>Finale: Moving the Immovable</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3789227814" "Mot's presence is undeniable within these caverns, you can feel something monstrous bearing down upon your very being."
// Script Variable ChatMessage :
"P3242869396" "The Sentinel absorbs the power of the civilians that were killed by the Knives of Vengeance!"
// Script Variable FloaterMessage :
"P4164160085" "Destroy the runes to remove the Sentinel's invincibility!"
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P3883870227" "Descend through the caverns to find the Sentinel of Mot"
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P2862884921" "Speak with Scirocco"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P683950350" "The new sacrifice has arrived."
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P1022528115" "You will join Scirocco, {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P259385746" "<t=2 d=2><t=5 d=5>He will feed Mot and empower us all."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P3523068218" "The memory of {HeroName} is becoming stronger as Mot grows."
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P979489635" "Your hope falls, {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P3088337236" "<t=2 d=2><t=5 d=5>The Sentinel will crush {HeroName}, should we fall."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P2797620342" "The Knives of Vengeance have served Mot well, their actions spreading more death than we can imagine."
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P3785636338" "You have no hope of defeating Mot, {HeroName}. Give up and be absorbed into something greater!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P1481906668" "<t=2 d=2><t=5 d=5>They try to fight us but to no avail. They do nothing but aid Mot!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P2262030162" "Mot absorbs more mages from the Circle of Thorns as time goes on."
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P3002003314" "You will join those Oranbegans inside of Mot, {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P2172004115" "<t=2 d=2><t=5 d=5>The Oranbegans made the mistake of sealing him once before. They will know Mot's anger!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P922401854" "Who is that woman who dares hold the attention of Mot? She does not worship Mot as we do!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P2181977520" "<t=2 d=2><t=5 d=5>Do not question the will of Mot."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P3298197606" "Lughebu is pleased with the progress we have made."
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P3351352993" "You can not defy Mot or the Pantheon!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P1762851059" "<t=2 d=2><t=5 d=5>Soon, they shall all be free, and we shall be made champions of this existence!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// CutScene 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// 5 Actor1 :
"P2890300425" "<t=4 d=4>The Sentinel of Mot. We finally meet"
// 5 Caption :
"P2141316657" "<x=0.7 y=0.3 t=5 d=5><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor DarkRed>Imad Malak, you have committed many atrocities in your life."
// 5 Caption :
"P156333028" "<x=0.7 y=0.3 t=5 d=5><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor DarkRed>Your family is ashamed of you, and your former comrades spit on your name."
// 9 Caption :
"P2778103473" "<x=0.3 y=0.2 t=9 d=9><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor DarkRed>Your life is a tarnish upon the Malak name. Show true honor in your last moments and give up your life, spare your former loved ones the pain of your existence"
// 2 Actor1 :
"P3540117292" "<t=5 d=5>..."
// 3 Caption :
"P2945786663" "<x=0.7 y=0.2 t=5 d=5><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor Black>Scirocco, a word, before you go."
// 3 Actor4 :
"P4095729163" "<t=3 d=3 em shrug>Yes?"
// 5 Actor5 :
"P575901224" "<t= 5 d=5 em disagree>I have sensed your torment growing since your plans with the Malleus Mundi failed."
// 5 Actor4 :
"P2367666781" "<t= 5 d=5>What of it?"
// 4 Actor5 :
"P2285709835" "<t=4 d=4 em no>The dead cannot change, Scirocco."
// 4 Actor5 :
"P2739744620" "<t=4 d=4>But, the living always have a chance."
// 5 Actor4 :
"P2528129625" "<t= 5 d=5 em thanks>Why are you telling me this now?"
// 5 Actor5 :
"P2527914613" "<t=5 d=5>You must settle your past, like we all have. Once and for all."
// 5 Actor4 :
"P2746417156" "<t= 5 d=5 em no>... The past is settled, my pale light in the darkness."
// 5 Actor4 :
"P1796389799" "<t= 5 d=5>It is the prison of the present and the future that I cannot escape."
// 4 Actor1 :
"P1671878044" "<t=4 d=4>... I accept"
// 2 Actor3 :
"P2540609362" "<t=5 d=5>NO! Take ME! You want a bad person, you want someone EVIL?!"
// 3 Actor1 :
"P154032998" "<f=Actor3>"
// 5 Actor3 :
"P645404868" "<t=5 d=5>I'm twenty times worse than Scirocco, so if you want someone, then take ME!"
// 5 Actor2 :
"P1171312774" "<t=5 d=5><color White><bgcolor DarkRed>Very well. You will be become part of Mot, Irena Rudenko!"
// 5 Actor3 :
"P2787428168" "Scirocco... you better understand why I'm doing this!"
// 2 Actor1 :
"P175885964" "<t=5 d=5>IRENA!!!"
// 2 Caption :
"P4263320461" "<x=0.5 y=0.3 t=5 d=5><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor DarkRed>And now, Imad Malak, it is time for you to become part of Mot."
// 3 Actor1 :
"P149696849" "<f=Actor2>"
// 4 Actor1 :
"P3954746184" "<t=4 d=4>No... I will not give in..."
// 3 Actor1 :
"P3864073019" "<t=3 d=3>Today... I will change..."
// 4 Actor1 :
"P2310378415" "<t=4 d=4>And I WILL save IRENA!"
// Script Variable ACTOR_2_NAME :
"P4043565442" "The Sentinel"
// Script Variable Actor5_Name :
"P3148347594" "Ghost Widow"

