// Script Variable Greeting :
"P2275253406" "Hello there son"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3793214176" "I'm dead!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P757328144" "Sentinel"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3657959788" "Your power cannot hope to stand against Mot, Scirocco. You were a fool."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1463741757" "{HeroName}. You willingly sent me to die, like all the others. Let me show you the power I have gained since then."
// Script Variable BOSS_75HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P1672177032" "Mot has shown me the way. You were foolish to ever stand against such power."
// Script Variable BOSS_DEAD_DIALOG :
"P2488063057" "This is not the end. Mot's power will be regained in mere moments, and I shall return."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3342602758" "Those that the Knives have killed fuel my power, {HeroName}. You cannot comprehend the feeling!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P5667011" "You cannot stop me. This is inevitable."
